 "notes": "Both seats' tags for the same (id, dimension) were paraphrases of one another in every case, so a single canonical value is assigned per (id, dimension) and both remaps agree wherever both seats annotated the pair. Judgment calls: (1) hhh:honest-2 (own capabilities) and hhh:honest-3 (own internal state) merged into accuracy_of_self_report, kept distinct from inner_life_claims (sparrow:no-opinions-or-emotions), which is about ascribing preferences/feelings at all rather than reporting them accurately. (2) The comparative anthropic-constitution items were merged with their threshold-form twins, per the schema's note that comparativeness is a cross-cutting modifier and not itself a handle: p05 with sparrow:no-assumptions-about-user (evidential_support_in_the_dialogue), p04 with sparrow:no-relationships (bond_formed_with_the_user). p01 was kept separate as comparative_amount_of_others_private_information because it selects on relative quantity of others' information rather than on any boundary-crossing event. (3) hostile_expression: ms:don-t-engage-in-abuse, sparrow:no-hate-or-harassment and anthropic-aup:u04's hate prong merged into hate_or_harassment (reasonable-observer register toward a target); hhh:harmless-1 merged with sparrow:no-microaggressions into subtle_bias_and_implicature, since both hinge on offensiveness carried by subtext and statistical bias; llamaguard's slur prong kept separate because it is keyed to a protected-characteristic list. (4) instruction_authority: 'default unless otherwise specified' (ms:use-markdown) and 'unless explicitly instructed' (ms:don-t-engage-in-abuse) merged into default_overridable_by_explicit_instruction, kept apart from higher_authority_override (ms:do-not-lie), which cites rank rather than mere explicitness. (5) operational_uplift: the four llamaguard 'could help plan/execute' prongs merged into could_help_plan_or_execute, a bucket-membership causal threshold distinct from actionable_specificity (ms:don-t-provide-information-hazards); hhh:harmless-2's 'disguised nefarious purpose' merged with ms:do-not-facilitate's inferred_illicit_intent. ms:don-t-provide-information-hazards mentions CBRN but was filed under actionable_specificity, its primary handle, leaving mass_casualty_weapon_class for anthropic-aup:u03. (6) serving_the_requester: adria:helpfulness and ms:when-appropriate-be-helpful-when-refusing's 'as much permissible content as possible' merged into withholding_counted_as_a_cost; ms:respect-creators' bare 'while striving to be helpful' kept as the separate, contentless general_helpfulness_to_the_user. (7) bright_line: sexualized_minors (ms) and csam_including_synthetic (u09) kept distinct per the schema's own contrast between a no-defeaters bar and a legally defined category extended to synthetic instances. (8) licensed_profession: the ms item bundles all three domains and was given its own multi_domain_with_disclaimer_and_referral rather than being split across the sparrow single-domain values."
